cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below.
title: "Baseweight Benchmark: fine-tuned open models versus frontier APIs on narrow, high-volume tasks"
abstract: >-
  A configurable pipeline comparing QLoRA fine-tuned open-weight models against
  frontier API baselines under training-data-constrained conditions. Reports
  accuracy, latency, cost per query and total cost of ownership, alongside raw
  predictions.
type: software
